   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Tom. You're verified, and I've pulled up order 5104 from Burger Barn.\n\nI see three items on it:\n- Classic burger ($12.00)\n- Bacon cheeseburger ($14.50)\n- Large fries ($5.00)\n\nWhich burger was wrong? The order shows a Classic burger and a Bacon cheeseburger, so tell me which one you received instead of the one you ordered.\n\nOnce I know that, I'll offer you one of two options for the wrong item:\n- A refund of its price ($12.00 for the Classic, or $14.50 for the Bacon cheeseburger) to your Visa ending in 4242, or\n- Account credit of the item's price plus 20% ($14.40 or $17.40).\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "I ordered the bacon cheeseburger, and what showed up was a veggie burger instead. The classic burger and fries were fine, but the whole meal feels ruined. I want my money back on my card, not credit."
