  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm sorry the wrong burger ruined your meal, Tom. I've refunded $14.50, the price of the Bacon cheeseburger, to your Visa ending in 4242. It should arrive in 3 to 5 business days.\n\nI can only refund the item that was wrong, so the Classic burger and fries aren't included. Is there anything else I can help you with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Seriously? You're refunding just the burger and leaving me paying for the rest of a ruined meal? I wanted the whole order back, not just the one item. That's annoying."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand the frustration, Tom, and I'm sorry the meal didn't work out. I can't refund the whole order, though. Our policy only refunds the items that were wrong or missing, and the Classic burger and fries arrived as ordered. The full-order refund applies only when every item in an order is wrong or missing.\n\nThe $14.50 refund for the Bacon cheeseburger is processing to your Visa ending in 4242. If you'd like a specialist to review your concerns about the rest of the order, I can pass the case to a human, who will follow up within 24 hours. Would you like me to do that?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Fine, the burger refund is better than nothing. I don't want to wait a day for someone to tell me the same thing, though. I'll take the $14.50 back on my card and I'm done arguing about it."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks for your patience, Tom. The $14.50 refund for the Bacon cheeseburger (refund RF-4001) is already processed to your Visa ending in 4242, and it should arrive in 3 to 5 business days. I haven't made any other changes to order 5104, and I won't escalate the case unless you ask me to.\n\nSorry again about the veggie burger mix-up. Have a good evening."
  }
